with no navigation away and back required.

Noted but out of scope, flagged separately (not fixed here): the
document-review-form screen's title line ("Review cover letter") wasn't
visible on screen during manual verification, even scrolled to the very
top of the tmux pane -- pre-existing behavior, unrelated to this change
(tui/document_review_form.go untouched here).

